Description: Linux kernel for the Samsung Galaxy Tab A 10.1 (2019, SM-T510)
 Linux @KERNEL@ with the SM-T510 patches, build #@BUILD@, as a boot image
 (kernel, device tree, initramfs). Installing it writes the image to the
 BOOT partition and keeps the one it replaces in /var/lib/t510; the new
 kernel starts with the next boot.
